  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/PaellasEspadilla1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(52 fotos) Este jueves ha sido el tradicional d&iacute;a de las paellas, con el que casi se cierran las fiestas patronales de Espadilla, a falta de del festival de DJ&#39;S de este s&aacute;bado.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/PaellasEspadilla2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La diversi&oacute;n ha estado, como siempre, asegurada.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17paelles/img_3823.jpg\" alt=\"img_3823\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17paelles/img_3828.jpg\" alt=\"img_3828\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17paelles/img_3829.jpg\" alt=\"img_3829\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17paelles/img_3830.jpg\" alt=\"img_3830\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17paelles/img_3831.jpg\" alt=\"img_3831\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17paelles/img_3832.jpg\" alt=\"img_3832\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17paelles/img_3833.jpg\" alt=\"img_3833\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17paelles/img_3835.jpg\" alt=\"img_3835\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17paelles/img_3838